		(at 74.15 110.4 -90)
		(descr "NXP MPXV4006DP, case 1351-01: 8-lead gull-wing SOP at 2.54 mm pitch, both ports on one face. Land pattern derived in hardware/interfaces/breath-sense-link/breath-sense-link.md (Land pattern): Figure 6's 1.52 mm pad width and 2.54 pitch [ds datasheets/analog/MPXV4006DP.pdf p.6], lengthened inward to 2.80 mm for case 1351's shorter feet, rows 16.00 mm centre to centre. Body 12.3 square [ds p.7]. Pin 1 top left, counter-clockwise; the ports point to -y (the datasheet top view turned 180 deg), and the courtyard takes them in: F 6.60, N 4.57 and T 3.30 at their maximum [ds p.20].")
